# One authoritative implementation

Project Leviathan is Hydra. Develop, document, target pull requests and prepare
releases from **main**. Work directly on main; do not create additional branches
unless the user explicitly requests one. The retired
`archive/dead-code-hydra-1.6.2` branch is historical preservation only.

Preserve history, immutable release tags and unfinished local work. Follow the
repository AGENTS.md and CONTRIBUTING.md. Main promotion is not live certification.
